e depot, take the ledger, get out together\\\"><meta name=\\\"hub:session-howto\\\" content=\\\"Stick/WASD move · R2/LMB fire · L2/RMB aim · Square/R reload or clear jam\\\"><meta name=\\\"hub:webgpu\\\" content=\\\"required\\\">\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\"><title>Contract</title><meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Every bullet has a buyer.\\\"><meta name=\\\"theme-color\\\" content=\\\"#2a2420\\\"><link rel=\\\"icon\\\" href=\\\"data:,\\\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#222b26;color:#eddfb8;font-family:Georgia,serif;touch-action:none}canvas{display:block;width:100vw\"'!important;height:100dvh!important;outline:none;position:fixed;inset:0}button,input,textarea{font:inherit;color:inherit}button{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid #bf945a;background:#283027;padding:14px 24px;font-size:22px}button:hover,button:focus{background:#665839;outline:2px solid #dbb676} [hidden]{display:none!important}#msg{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:3;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:linear-gradient(#495664,#ab8857 65%,#3e422c);font-size:28px;text-align:center;padding:5vw;gap:20px}#support{position:fixed;z-index:5;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#263c47,#b78c60 62%,#4d5134 62%,#242c23);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:5vw}#support .copy{width:min(900px,100%);padding:5vw;background:#1c231ded;border:1px solid #bd9f64}h1{font-size:clamp(40px,8vw,108px);line-height:1;margin:0 0 24px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.02em}#support p{font-size:clamp(20px,3vw,30px);line-height:1.5}#support label{display:block;margin:20px 0;font-size:24px}#support input{max-width:100%}#resume-lock{position:fixed;z-index:4;bottom:12%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#20291fe8;border:1px solid #a98d57;padding:12px 24px;font-size:20px}#card-clock{position:fixed;z-index:4;right: