{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_77","type":"agent_message","text":"The first simulation tests found two substantive issues: the asset reader rejected the guns’ new socket names, and the fire spread farther in a minute than intended. I’m extending socket support and tuning the spread before moving on to browser tests.\n"}}
