{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_83","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/bot.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('if let Some((_,n))=enemy{if \"'!self.safe_town()'\"','if let Some((_,n))=enemy{if self.contract>0&&\"'!self.safe_town()'\"');s=s.replace('if self.screen==\\\"companion\\\"','if self.screen==\\\"safehouse\\\"&&self.current_goal().is_some_and(|g|g.kind==\\\"night\\\"){i.act=act::SELECT;return i;}if self.screen==\\\"sleep\\\"{i.act=act::SELECT+3;return i;}if self.screen==\\\"companion\\\"');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/ai.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('let mut attackers=0;','if self.contract==0&&\"'!self.session{return;}let mut attackers=0;'\"',1);p.write_text(s)\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/campaign.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('n.target&&n.tagged','n.target&&(n.tagged||n.hp<=0.)');p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat > tools/build-game.sh <<'SH'\n#\"'!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")/..\"\npython3 tools/page.py\nTASK_TITLE=$(python3 -c '\"'import tomllib; print(tomllib.load(open(\\\"engine/game/merc/strings.toml\\\",\\\"rb\\\"))[\\\"title\\\"])')\nTASK_SLUG=\\\"\"'${TASK_TITLE// /-}-Far-Cry-2-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-062935\"\nTASK_OUTPUT=\"$(pwd)/../${TASK_SLUG}.html\"\n(cd engine && CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=10 scripts/build-web.sh --single-file --scene merc --title \"$TASK_TITLE\" --description \"Every bullet has a buyer. A first-person contract in the last dry season.\" --theme-color '\"'#2a2420' --out \\\"\"'$TASK_OUTPUT\")\npython3 tools/check-package.py \"$TASK_OUTPUT\"\nSH\ncat > tools/check-package.py <<'\"'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport sys,re\npage=Path(sys.argv[1]);s=page.read_text();client=Path('hub/session.js').read_text()\nfirst=re.search(r'<script[\"'^>]*>(.*?)</script>'\"',s,re.S)\nassert first and first.group(1)==client,'Session client changed or is not first'\nassert s.index('<meta charset')<first.start()\nassert 'hub:session-mode' in s and 'shared-world' in s\nassert 'wasm' in s and len(s)>1000000\nprint(f'Packed {page.name}: {page.stat().st_size:,} bytes; session client verified.')\nPY\nchmod +x tools/build-game.sh\n./tools/build-game.sh > notes/build-web.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_87","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Second implementation checkpoint\n- View: first-person CameraRig path; typed RenderFrame.merc; NO_FOG; smooth terrain/sky, grass/acacias/river, compounds, fire/smoke, new gun/vehicle/environment props, held map/GPS, native pose arms with IK, Verlet sight rag.\n- UI: pav_ui/tenfoot painter kit and native stencil font (OFL); title/settings/dev/pause/story/shop/locker/ending. Headless capture uses same UI.\n- Shell: dedicated MercApp + Driver (pav_app/merc_shell.rs), fixed tick, JS input externs, saves, test hooks, sessions/server.\n- Audio: native synth Pluck; original generated music/SFX/voices with gain buses in pav_audio/merc.rs.\n- Web: web/bridge.js implements input/Hub/BC/WebRTC; tools/page.py writes engine/web/index.html with unmodified first session client. Hub reduced to required protocol files.\n- Build: tools/build-game.sh; first wasm dist build running, notes/build-web.log (session 39178). Native pav rebuild session 68229; native test rebuild session 66299. Earlier check sessions exited.\n- First sim suite found 2 issues (1 critical): unsupported sockets -> missing gun assets; excessive fire propagation -> oversized snapshots. Extended sockets and reduced spread_rate to .16. 13 other tests passed. Feedback log updated.\n- Just added water zones and compound colliders, not yet compiled/verified.\n- Next: finish compile, capture title/gameplay; run native suite and campaign bot (ignored test for now), fix behavior, add browser/hub/audio tests and full coverage; final package/feedback/exit interview/process cleanup.\nEOF\ntail -50 notes/build-native.log && tail -35 notes/build-web.log && tail -55 notes/test-sim.log\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
