{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_94","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/ai.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('let near=dist<150.;','let near=dist<80.;').replace('if near&&n.entity.is_none(){','if near&&n.entity.is_none(){n.pos.y=terrain::height(&data,n.pos.x,n.pos.z)+0.05;');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/mod.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('if let Some(p)=sim.feet(id){n.pos=p;}','if let Some(p)=sim.feet(id){n.pos=p;let ground=terrain::height(&self.data,p.x,p.z);if n.pos.y<ground-0.5{n.pos.y=ground+0.05;sim.set_position(id,n.pos);}}');p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> notes/feedback.md <<'EOF'\n\nVisual checks caught title/tagline overlap and overly blocky acacia crowns; title lines now position independently, canopy assets use broad faceted lathe profiles, and the title camera sits on the road. Campaign bot caught a critical streaming issue: NPCs could spawn outside the active physics ring, fall beneath terrain and make a guard post impossible to clear. NPC activation now stays inside loaded physics and restores grounded positions.\nEOF\nCARGO_BUILD_JOBS=10 cargo test --manifest-path engine/Cargo.toml -p pav_core --test merc campaign_bot -- --ignored --nocapture > notes/test-campaign.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_95","type":"agent_message","text":"The simulation checks now pass. The first screenshot exposed title text overlap and overly square tree canopies; both have been corrected. The campaign bot also found a guard-post blocker: enemies could spawn outside loaded terrain and fall underground. I’ve fixed their activation range and am rerunning the campaign while checking browser input and loading.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_96","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > tests/smoke.py <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\nimport json,time\nROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\nPAGE=ROOT.parent/(ROOT.name+'.html')\nFLAGS=['--enable-unsafe-webgpu','--enable-features=Vulkan','--use-vulkan=swiftshader','--use-angle=swiftshader','--disable-dev-shm-usage']\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n browser=p.chromium.launch(headless=True,args=FLAGS)\n page=browser.new_page(viewport={'width':960,'height':540})\n errors=[]\n page.on('pageerror',lambda e:errors.append(str(e)))\n page.on('console',lambda e: print('console',e.type,e.text) if e.type in ['error','warning'] else None)\n page.goto(PAGE.as_uri()+'?test=1&nodraw=1',wait_until='load')\n try:\n  page.wait_for_function('window.__game && JSON.parse(__game.ui).drawn>0',timeout=90000)\n  print('READY',page.evaluate('JSON.parse(__game.status)'))\n  page.keyboard.press('ArrowDown');page.keyboard.press('Enter')\n  page.wait_for_function('JSON.parse(__game.status).screen===\\\"difficulty\\\"',timeout=20000)\n  page.keyboard.press('ArrowDown');page.keyboard.press('Enter')\n  page.wait_for_function('JSON.parse(__game.status).screen===\\\"dossier\\\"',timeout=20000)\n  page.keyboard.press('Enter')\n  page.wait_for_function('JSON.parse(__game.status).screen===\\\"playing\\\"',timeout=20000)\n  print('PLAYING',page.evaluate('JSON.parse(__game.status).pos'))\n  page.keyboard.down('KeyW');page.wait_for_timeout(1000);page.keyboard.up('KeyW')\n  print('MOVED',page.evaluate('JSON.parse(__game.status).pos'))\n  page.keyboard.press('Escape');page.wait_for_function('JSON.parse(__game.status).screen===\\\"pause\\\"',timeout=20000)\n  print('PAUSED')\n  page.screenshot(path=str(ROOT/'notes/browser-smoke.png'))\n except Exception as e:\n  print('ERROR',e)\n  print(page.locator('body').inner_text()[:2000])\n  page.screenshot(path=str(ROOT/'notes/browser-error.png'))\n print('PAGE ERRORS',errors)\n browser.close()\nPY\npython3 tests/smoke.py > notes/browser-smoke.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
