{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_102","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_view/src/merc/mod.rs');s=p.read_text().replace('coarse:Option<Arc<MeshData>>,rag:','coarse:Option<Arc<MeshData>>,grass:Option<Arc<MeshData>>,rag:');s=s.replace(' // Vegetation is derived','''\n if self.grass.is_none(){let mut m=MeshData::default();for blade in 0..20{let a=blade as f32*2.399;let offset=Vec3::new(a.sin()*0.43,0.,a.cos()*0.43);let side=Vec3::new(a.cos(),0.,-a.sin());let lean=Vec3::new(a.sin()*0.16,0.,a.cos()*0.16);let height=0.72+(blade%5) as f32*0.06;for k in 0..3{let t=k as f32/3.;let u=(k+1) as f32/3.;let center=|v:f32|offset+lean*v*v+Vec3::Y*(-0.5+height*v);let wa=side*(0.023*(1.-t)+0.001);let wb=side*(0.023*(1.-u)+0.001);m.push_quad([center(t)-wa,center(t)+wa,center(u)+wb,center(u)-wb],Vec3::Y);}}self.grass=Some(Arc::new(m));}\n scene.custom_meshes.push((MeshKey::Custom(0x7fff002),self.grass.as_ref().unwrap().clone()));\n // Vegetation is derived''');s=s.replace('part(scene,MeshKey::Tuft,p+','part(scene,MeshKey::Custom(0x7fff002),p+');s=s.replace('let color=c(\\\"#c9a24b\\\")*(0.75+terrain::hash(x,z,8)*0.5)','let color=c(\\\"#c9a24b\\\")*(0.90+terrain::hash(x,z,8)*0.14)');p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> notes/feedback.md <<'EOF'\n\nBrowser smoke from file:// passed: startup, keyboard dossier flow, real movement, pause, and zero JS errors. A second campaign run found water-zone colour was incorrectly constructed as a string rather than the engine's linear RGB array; fixed the construction. Field screenshot led to a new slender-blade grass mesh (engine's generic tuft was too broad in first person).\nEOF\nCARGO_BUILD_JOBS=10 cargo check --manifest-path engine/Cargo.toml -p pav_app > notes/check-app.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_103","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/merc/mod.rs');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('if self.attracting{if let Some(backup)','if self.attracting{let requested=input.act;if let Some(backup)');s=s.replace('self.sync_player(sim);i=InputFrame::default();','self.sync_player(sim);if requested==act::SELECT+3{self.parent=\\\"title\\\".into();self.open(\\\"settings\\\");}i=InputFrame::default();');s=s.replace('self.idle>=10.||self.touch_only{','self.idle>=10.||(self.touch_only&&self.screen==\\\"title\\\"){');p.write_text(s)\np=Path('web/bridge.js');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"info&&\"'!started&&e.code==='\"'Enter'\\\",\\\"info&&\"'!started&&(e.code==='\"'Enter'||e.key==='Enter')\\\");p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat > tests/hub.py <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\nimport threading,http.server,socketserver,urllib.request,json,sys,urllib.parse\nROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\nclass Handler(http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler):\n def __init__(self,*a,**kw):super().__init__(*a,directory=str(ROOT.parent),**kw)\n def log_message(self,*a):pass\nserver=http.server.ThreadingHTTPServer(('127.0.0.1',0),Handler)\nthread=threading.Thread(target=server.serve_forever,daemon=True);thread.start()\nport=server.server_address[1]\nbase=f'http://127.0.0.1:{port}'\nhtml=(ROOT.parent/(ROOT.name+'.html')).name\nassert '<title>A Fair Cry</title>' in urllib.request.urlopen(base+'/'+html).read().decode()\ncases=['players=2&auto=1','players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&auto=1','players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&scenario=host-leave&auto=1','players=2&scenario=server&auto=1']\ntry:\n with sync_playwright() as p:\n  browser=p.chromium.launch(headless=True,args=['--enable-unsafe-webgpu','--enable-features=Vulkan','--use-vulkan=swiftshader','--use-angle=swiftshader','--disable-dev-shm-usage'])\n  for idx,case in enumerate(cases):\n   page=browser.new_page(viewport={'width':800,'height':600})\n   errors=[];page.on('pageerror',lambda e:errors.append(str(e)))\n   game=urllib.parse.quote('../../'+html+'?test=1&nodraw=1',safe='')\n   url=base+'/'+ROOT.name+'/hub/harness.html?game='+game+'&'+case\n   page.goto(url)\n   try:\n    page.wait_for_function('window.__hubCheck && document.body.dataset.complete===\\\"true\\\"',timeout=180000)\n    report=page.evaluate('window.__hubCheck')\n   except Exception as e:\n    report={'error':str(e),'body':page.locator('body').inner_text()}\n   (ROOT/f'notes/hub-{idx}.json').write_text(json.dumps(report,indent=2))\n   print(case,json.dumps(report),errors,flush=True)\n   page.close()\n  browser.close()\nfinally:server.shutdown();server.server_close()\nPY\npython3 tests/hub.py > notes/hub-test.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
